o;s 4 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, March to April came in at 66% and May to June at 143%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 44% on the middle. Grid 20017 had its driest year in 2001 at 60%.</p>"}
